# ─── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Firebase service-account key, however it gets named/downloaded — never in the repo,
# even if it's accidentally saved here instead of outside the project folder.
*firebase*adminsdk*.json
*serviceAccountKey*.json
firebase-credentials*.json
# Any other stray copy of env values, whatever it gets named (caught real leaked
# secrets sitting in files like env.verify-token-update.txt on 22 Aug 2026 — this
# pattern exists specifically because that happened once already).
env.*.txt
env-*.txt
*.env.txt

